Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Shell zsh
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Hide
Type "source /tmp/cdai-demo/setup.zsh"
Enter
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "cdai petal"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Type "cdai latest petalworks folder"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2200ms
Type "cdai tictac"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1600ms
Type "3d"
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
